; [0.8.1-RT14] (#954), work #955: AFLAGS, a value of the session from 0 to 31 that is 16
; at start-up (card PT14, point 1; docs/adr/0056, point 2; DECISIONI.md, 2026-11-22,
; "Decisioni D1-D10 del piano della 0.8.1", point 4), and the aliases ATT and ATTDEF of
; -ATTDEF. With AFLAGS 16 the modes start with Lock position=Y and the ATTDEF has
; lock-position=yes. A value out of range gives the message of the values of the session
; (PEDITACCEPT, ATTREQ: "Requires an integer between 0 and <max>.") and the question
; repeats; Enter keeps the value. At the end AFLAGS takes the modes used: 5 with
; Invisible turned off gives 4. AFLAGS has no undo step; each -ATTDEF is one Attdef step,
; undone and redone.
; Source: Matleyx78/dxf-test-file, commit 2aafbb1fa17abc67fdf2ff7de26a34b70e79b736
; (CC0-1.0): autocad-attributi.txt (AutoCAD 2021, Italian, translated as docs/adr/0056,
; point 2): the questions and the AFLAGS values after each -ATTDEF.
; ~box (docs/adr/0022): LiberationSans-Regular.ttf of resources/fonts, read with a small
; reader of its head, hhea, OS/2, cmap and hmtx tables: cap height 1409, ascent 1854,
; descent -434, summed advances; an ATTDEF shows its tag.
